        <div class="player-note">
          <strong>"And I don't want the world to see me<br>'cause I don't think that they'd understand."</strong><br><br>
          I think about this line a lot. You're someone who keeps your most important feelings to yourself — not because you don't have them, but because they're yours and they're real and the world doesn't always deserve them.<br><br>
          This song is ours. But this line especially feels like you.<br>I'm glad you let me close enough to hear it anyway.
